    "review": "Do not inherit the upstream blanket standalone CI rule or rewrite historical module fixtures. Two WrapperCdkTableApp ContentChildren queries add descendants:false; all 74 case callbacks are equal but query depth is a substantive fixture contract. Lint decorator requirements and spec exemptions also change. The owned legacy table suite retains its module/declarations preparation, compileComponents and finite legacy selectors. These complete source changes do not authorize forcing every fixture/component standalone, changing local query behavior or inferring compiler/peer-floor results."
  },
  "decision": "Do not inherit the upstream blanket standalone CI rule or rewrite historical module fixtures. Two WrapperCdkTableApp ContentChildren queries add descendants:false; all 74 case callbacks are equal but query depth is a substantive fixture contract. Lint decorator requirements and spec exemptions also change. The owned legacy table suite retains its module/declarations preparation, compileComponents and finite legacy selectors. These complete source changes do not authorize forcing every fixture/component standalone, changing local query behavior or inferring compiler/peer-floor results. Exact compiler/Node/RxJS/peer floors, consumer/SSR/browser gates, private command-source reconciliation and independent audit remain separate. No publication.",
